          "label": "7 论文、源码与核对快照",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "id": "sources-body",
              "kind": "text",
              "html": "<p><strong>Debasis Kundu 与 Mohammad Z. Raqab，2009</strong> · Estimation of R = P(Y &lt; X) for three-parameter Weibull distribution</p><p>当前方法入口：<code>python/methods/mmle.py</code>。核对时间 2026-11-02T12:51:05+08:00；Git基线 2b3d01383c，工作区含未提交改动，以下哈希标识本轮实际文件。</p><p style=\"font:14px/1.8 Consolas,monospace;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">入口SHA-256 eebc150796acbe565a356c13dc8c9e5ebfd69302870cc1c1b7c63bbf8bf948ec</p><p><a href=\"assets/evidence.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">查看逐项原文与源码摘录</a> · <a href=\"assets/provenance.json\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">查看来源与哈希</a> · <a href=\"assets/methods.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">其他方法</a></p><p>摘录用于本轮讨论，不是另一份可编辑的算法实现。源文件变化后应重新核对；审阅期间不修改估计器或原论文。</p>"
